person.note:
Nigerian Ambassador to the United States from March 1968 to April 1972;
                    Permanent Secretary, Nigerian Ministry of External Affairs from May 1972; Acting
                    Foreign Minister

Ambassador to the Federal Republic of Germany from July 1969 to February 1972;
                    Deputy Secretary of Defense from February 1972 to January 1973; Deputy Secretary
                    of State from January 1973 to May 1974; Ambassador to France from 1974 to

Chairman of the Atomic Energy Commission from August 1971 to February 1973;
